      "external": true,
      "docstring": "Find the `n`-th natural number satisfying `p` (indexed from `0`, so `nth p 0` is the first\nnatural number satisfying `p`), or `0` if there is no such number. See also\n`Subtype.orderIsoOfNat` for the order isomorphism with ℕ when `p` is infinitely often true. "
    },
